  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/questionText
    english: Where do you see yourself in five years?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a1/text
    english: Doing what I dreamed of.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: If only it were that simple.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Dreams are not a plan.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a2/text
    english: In a position of responsibility.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I have no idea.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Ambitious. Good.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a3/text
    english: Somewhere stable.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Somewhere. Anywhere.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_1/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Stable. Sure.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/questionText
    english: Would you give up your dream for this job?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a1/text
    english: Yes, if I had to.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Did I just say that?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: A realistic answer.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a2/text
    english: No.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: It's the only thing I have.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Then why are you here?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a3/text
    english: I'd find a way to do both.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Both is exhausting.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_dream_2/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Everyone says that.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/questionText
    english: Tell me about your time at university.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a1/text
    english: I mostly studied alone.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: It was a lonely four years.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Self-motivated, then.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a2/text
    english: I joined every club I could.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: And finished none of them.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Involved. Good.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a3/text
    english: I'd rather talk about the future.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Please change the subject.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_1/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Avoiding the question.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/questionText
    english: What was your biggest academic failure?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a1/text
    english: A group project that fell apart.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I carried that team. For nothing.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Teamwork matters here.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a2/text
    english: I haven't failed.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: A lie. A confident one.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Everyone has failed.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a3/text
    english: I failed an exam and learned from it.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: A rehearsed answer.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_education_2/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: A standard answer.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/questionText
    english: What do you do when you're not working?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a1/text
    english: I work on my passion projects.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: That's all I do.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: No work-life balance, then.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a2/text
    english: I rest.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I stare at the ceiling.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Rest is important.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a3/text
    english: I look for jobs.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: True. Painfully true.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_1/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: ...I see.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/questionText
    english: Would your passion ever get in the way of your work?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a1/text
    english: Never.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Liar.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: That's what they all say.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a2/text
    english: It would make my work better.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Please let that be true.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: We prefer focus.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a3/text
    english: I can keep them separate.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I've been separating them for years.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_cat_passion_2/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Good.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/questionText
    english: Artists rarely last in this industry. Why should we invest in you?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a1/text
    english: I never stop practicing.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I practice every night.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Practice isn't a deliverable.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a2/text
    english: I can learn other skills.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Another thing to give up.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Flexible. Good.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a3/text
    english: Maybe you shouldn't.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I can't believe I said that.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_artist/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: ...
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/questionText
    english: Why do you want to become a game developer?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a1/text
    english: I love creating experiences.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Games have always meant something to me.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Passion alone doesn't make you qualified.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a2/text
    english: I want to make people feel something.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: That sounded better in my head.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: This is a business, not an art project.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a3/text
    english: It's stable enough these days.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: That's not even true.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_dream_game_dev/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: That is... not true at all.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/questionText
    english: Many applicants come from Big City University. What makes you different?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a1/text
    english: I worked on projects outside class.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I hope that counts for something.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Projects. Everyone says that.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a2/text
    english: Honestly, nothing yet.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: That came out wrong.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: At least you're honest.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a3/text
    english: I learn fast.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Please believe me.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_big_city/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: We'll see.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/questionText
    english: Why did you choose Small Town University?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a1/text
    english: It was close to home.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Not the most inspiring answer.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Convenient. I suppose.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a2/text
    english: It taught me to work with what I have.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I almost believe that myself.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: That's a nice way to say it.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a3/text
    english: I couldn't afford anywhere else.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Why did I say that out loud?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_edu_small_town/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Oh. I see.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/questionText
    english: What is your greatest weakness?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a1/text
    english: I care too much.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Everyone says that.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: A cliche.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a2/text
    english: I overthink everything.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Like this answer.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a2/hrResponse/0/text
    english: At least that's real.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a3/text
    english: I don't know when to stop.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a3/playerReaction/0/text
    english: I should stop.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_weakness/answers/a3/hrResponse/0/text
    english: Noted.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_why/questionText
    english: Why should we hire you?
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_why/answers/a1/text
    english: Because I'm motivated.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_why/answers/a1/playerReaction/0/text
    english: Because I need to eat.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_why/answers/a1/hrResponse/0/text
    english: So are the others.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_why/answers/a2/text
    english: I'm not sure you should.
    thai: 
  - key: question/q_gen_why/answers/a2/playerReaction/0/text
